        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This was originally part of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3527864786\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41583\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41583/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41583\">#41583</a>, but as another option is just to remove the entire section, i pulled this into a different PR. We can add something like this, or, optionally, get rid of the list altogether.</p>",
